{
  "name": "dsh-balance-pill",
  "version": "0.1.6",
  "description": "余额徽章 —— 在 DeepSeek Harness 输入框下方状态行末尾显示账户余额，颜色随余额档位变化，并标出当前是高峰还是空闲计费时段（空闲单价为高峰的一半）；面板给出充值/赠金拆分、余额趋势、今日/本周/近 7 天与本轮会话消耗、峰谷预估与余额耗尽预估，掉档或时段切换时浮出提醒（看门狗会从休眠唤醒 / 校时后的时钟跳变中自愈，时段提醒的冷却按方向分账），并可在「设置 → 通用设置」里调整全部行为。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "license": "MIT",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.6"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "balance",
    "ui"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build": "node scripts/build.mjs",
    "test": "node --test tests/runtime.test.mjs",
    "install:plugin": "node scripts/install.mjs",
    "verify": "node scripts/build.mjs && node --test tests/runtime.test.mjs"
  },
  "dependencies": {},
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.4"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-api-remotes"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    },
    "manifestVersion": 1
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./client/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "client",
    "src",
    "scripts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md"
  ]
}
